## 9. Security Configuration

The security groups were configured to allow HTTP traffic to the load balancer from the internet and HTTP traffic from the load balancer to the EC2 instance.

- **Load balancer security group:** Allows inbound TCP port 80 from `0.0.0.0/0`.
- **EC2 security group:** Allows inbound TCP port 80 from the load balancer security group.

This configuration limits direct HTTP access to the instance through the configured security group rule.

