## 11. Conclusion

The AWS web-server deployment was successfully configured and verified. The launch template, Auto Scaling Group, target group, CPU target-tracking policy, and Application Load Balancer were created. The load balancer reached the `active` state, the registered EC2 target became `healthy`, and HTTP requests returned `200 OK` with the default Nginx welcome page.

These results demonstrate successful end-to-end HTTP connectivity through the load balancer to the Nginx web server. The configuration also establishes the foundation for scaling the web tier according to CPU utilization.

